      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA KICK IT (2) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, paving the way for a 4.5 lengths win at Warrnambool over 390m in 22.15. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. GUNAI GAGA (7) scored by a space in one of the fastest times of the card two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 5th and beaten 7 lengths at Shepparton (25.66). The form out of last race has been strong. Likely to be about the money. WHIRLY WIND (8) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (25.72) at Shepparton. Expected to be in this for a long way. SWEET I AM (1) placed last time (22.15) at Shepparton in a Grade 5 FIN, finishing second and beaten 3 lengths. Already a winner from this draw.",
